    "G05B23/0275": {
      "code": "G05B23/0275",
      "level": 11,
      "parent": "G05B23/0259",
      "ja": "｛障害の分離と識別，例．障害の分類;障害の原因又は根源の推定｝",
      "en": "{Fault isolation and identification, e.g. classify fault; estimate cause or root of failure}",
      "count": 975,
      "ipcCode": "G05B23/02",
      "coreCode": "G05B23/02",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_G05B.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
    "G05B23/0278": {
      "code": "G05B23/0278",
      "level": 12,
      "parent": "G05B23/0275",
      "ja": "｛定性的なもの，例．ｉｆ－ｔｈｅｎルール;ファジィ論理;ルックアップテーブル;症状検索;故障モード影響解析（ＦＭＥＡ）｝",
      "en": "{Qualitative, e.g. if-then rules; Fuzzy logic; Lookup tables; Symptomatic search; FMEA}",
      "count": 351,
      "ipcCode": "G05B23/02",
      "coreCode": "G05B23/02",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_G05B.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
    "G05B23/0281": {
      "code": "G05B23/0281",
      "level": 12,
      "parent": "G05B23/0275",
      "ja": "｛定量的なもの，例．数学的距離;クラスタリング;ニューラルネットワーク;統計的分析｝",
      "en": "{Quantitative, e.g. mathematical distance; Clustering; Neural networks; Statistical analysis}",
      "count": 460,
      "ipcCode": "G05B23/02",
      "coreCode": "G05B23/02",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_G05B.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
    "G05B23/0283": {
      "code": "G05B23/0283",
      "level": 11,
      "parent": "G05B23/0259",
      "ja": "｛予測的な保守，例．システムの監視を含み，監視結果に基づいて，監視対象システムの保守計画に関する決定を行うもの;残存耐用年数（ＲＵＬ）を推定するもの(予防的な保守，すなわち，システムを監視することなく利用可能なリソースに従って保守を計画するもの Ｇ０６Ｑ１０／０６)｝",
      "en": "{Predictive maintenance, e.g. involving the monitoring of a system and, based on the monitoring results, taking decisions on the maintenance schedule of the monitored system; Estimating remaining useful life [RUL] (preventive maintenance, i.e. planning maintenance according to the available resources without monitoring the system G06Q10/06)}",
      "count": 3253,
      "ipcCode": "G05B23/02",
      "coreCode": "G05B23/02",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_G05B.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
